@{
    ViewBag.Title = "Live Chart Help";
}
@section Styles
{
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/Content/MovementCharts/Introduction.less" type="text/css" />
}
<div class="body-container">
    <div class="page-header">
        <h3>
            Live Chart Help</h3>
    </div>
    <img src="~/Content/Images/help-image.png" class="img-polaroid help-image" />
    <div>
        1. Home vs Away team names including current score and time played.</div>
    <div>
        2. Bet type & Odds options:
        <ul>
            <li>Bet type: Handicap & Over/Under, <em>which are abbreviated as HDP & OU respectively.</em>
            </li>
            <li>Team selection: Home/Away team for HDP, or Over/Under </li>
            <li>Odds selection for odds chart. Odds are differentiated by HDP (or OU line) values.</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
    <div>
        3. Current Movement: The figure is the accumulation of betting data in the last
        {x} minute(s), based on players betting choices (Home/Away; Over/Under).</div>
    <div>
        4. Current odds value based on options from (2).</div>
    <div>
        5. Odds chart:
        <ul>
            <li>Line chart of odds value from match’s kick-of-time until currenttime. </li>
            <li>Title includes odds value along with handicap value & match time (minute) which
                reflect the point that your cursor hovers on the chart. </li>
            <li>A red exclamation mark(!) indicates a change in HDP (or OU line) value.</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
    <div>
        6. Market Movement Chart: Percentage chart line of punters choosing Home vs Away
        team or Over vs Under. Percentage figure on the title is the percentage of the match
        minute that your cursor locates. Each point is the accumulation of betting data
        in the last {x} minute(s).</div>
    <div>
        7. Match timeline contains events: kick-off, half-time, 2nd-half, goal, and red
        card.</div>
</div>
